WEBVTT

01:26.440 --> 01:31.850
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.179 --> 01:39.590
[Episode 4: Acquiring Liansheng House]

01:57.230 --> 01:58.676
Please wait here for a moment.

01:58.700 --> 02:00.150
OK.

02:16.460 --> 02:19.030
What an important guest to Guanghui Bank!

02:24.490 --> 02:27.050
[Mo Bufan, Yuntai Sect]

02:27.150 --> 02:29.576
"In the snowy mountains lies a noble man."

02:29.600 --> 02:33.120
"Out of the moonlit forest comes a beauty."

02:33.630 --> 02:35.080
Hello, Mr. Mo.

02:40.910 --> 02:42.756
I wonder which one you look forward to,

02:42.780 --> 02:45.006
a beauty, or a noble man?

02:45.030 --> 02:48.636
A noble man is dull, and a beauty is distractive.

02:48.660 --> 02:50.110
I want neither of them.

02:50.490 --> 02:52.170
I didn't expect you, Master's last disciple

02:52.170 --> 02:54.316
and taken in as an exception,

02:54.340 --> 02:56.710
would be so young and handsome.

02:56.870 --> 02:58.195
I am still a novice

02:58.219 --> 03:00.050
and would appreciate your kind help.

03:04.870 --> 03:07.050
This gentleman looks like no ordinary man.

03:07.430 --> 03:09.220
Is he a fellow disciple?

03:09.270 --> 03:09.976
Mr. Kang,

03:10.000 --> 03:11.640
meet your senior and fellow disciple, Mr. Yun.

03:13.060 --> 03:14.510
I'm Yun Xiang.

03:14.990 --> 03:16.256
Kang Qiao.

03:16.280 --> 03:17.616
Come on, have a seat.

03:17.640 --> 03:19.090
Come on.

03:27.990 --> 03:30.126
As soon as you came to town,

03:30.150 --> 03:31.710
I sorted out all of Wen Cong's accounts

03:31.710 --> 03:33.106
in Nandu.

03:33.130 --> 03:34.906
You came to Nandu

03:34.930 --> 03:36.620
for these, right?

03:39.270 --> 03:41.560
You're indeed very resourceful, Mr. Mo.

03:44.290 --> 03:46.246
I suppose it would be against the rules

03:46.270 --> 03:47.846
for me to take away these ledgers.

03:47.870 --> 03:49.320
Of course.

03:55.550 --> 03:57.526
Don't worry, chum.

03:57.550 --> 03:58.846
Take your time.

03:58.870 --> 04:00.320
It's OK.

04:00.550 --> 04:01.726
I developed a photographic memory

04:01.750 --> 04:03.570
a long time ago at Yuntai.

04:06.710 --> 04:08.540
Of what happened to Mr. Wen...

04:09.230 --> 04:10.970
Are you aware?

04:12.470 --> 04:14.326
Nourishing a viper in his bosom

04:14.350 --> 04:16.430
was exactly what Wen Cong had been doing.

04:16.710 --> 04:19.100
Was there anyone behind Qi Tianfeng?

04:24.170 --> 04:26.390
Have you ever wondered

04:26.840 --> 04:28.666
why I was not involved

04:28.690 --> 04:31.530
in this Wen Cong incident?

04:32.430 --> 04:33.880
I'm puzzled indeed.

04:34.110 --> 04:36.126
Confidentiality is of top priority for Yuntai.

04:36.150 --> 04:38.886
Wen Cong was in charge of the affairs of Nandu.

04:38.910 --> 04:41.816
I collect information and pass on messages.

04:41.840 --> 04:43.816
I never asked about his affairs.

04:43.840 --> 04:47.080
And he never asked about mine.

04:48.210 --> 04:50.010
No wonder this tragedy happened to Mr. Wen.

04:50.660 --> 04:53.676
Resourceful though you are, Mr. Mo,

04:53.700 --> 04:55.890
you were not at all alert to it.

04:57.780 --> 04:59.230
Now I see.

05:01.190 --> 05:03.090
I suppose these old accounts of Mr. Wen's

05:03.630 --> 05:05.350
do need some looking into.

05:14.950 --> 05:17.380
You could've offered some help, kid!

05:18.530 --> 05:21.306
That man was really taught by Master himself?

05:21.330 --> 05:22.606
Not only that,

05:22.630 --> 05:25.076
normally disciples stayed for 3 to 5 years,

05:25.100 --> 05:27.876
but Master kept him by his side for over 10 years.

05:27.900 --> 05:29.780
You see how highly he was thought of?

05:30.230 --> 05:31.680
That's strange.

05:31.750 --> 05:34.100
He was shadowed by people of the Cao Sect today

05:34.170 --> 05:35.870
but didn't seem to be aware of it.

05:36.580 --> 05:38.110
Are you sure

05:36.680 --> 05:42.100
[Everlasting Loyalty]

05:38.270 --> 05:39.886
that Jin Biao is not with him?

05:39.910 --> 05:40.806
It's true.

05:40.830 --> 05:42.056
And the woman?

05:42.080 --> 05:43.786
She left alone early in the morning.

05:43.810 --> 05:46.566
Go gather the best men in the sect.

05:46.590 --> 05:48.040
OK.

05:49.190 --> 05:50.980
Yun Xiang went straight to Liansheng House

05:50.980 --> 05:52.770
and then Guanghui Bank

05:52.790 --> 05:54.750
after arriving in Nandu.

05:55.460 --> 05:57.176
Do you realize what it means?

05:57.200 --> 06:00.386
He's planning to resume Wen Cong's business?

06:00.410 --> 06:02.820
You say you're Wen Cong's goddaughter.

06:03.030 --> 06:04.796
But why should we believe you?

06:04.820 --> 06:07.896
I've answered this question many times today.

06:07.920 --> 06:10.170
Where is this crazy woman from?

06:12.210 --> 06:15.036
After this insult, you'll ask me for the IOU.

06:15.060 --> 06:16.140
If I can't present it,

06:16.160 --> 06:18.166
you'll say I have no evidence to prove

06:18.190 --> 06:20.406
that you owe my godfather money, right?

06:20.430 --> 06:22.510
I'm only being reasonable.

06:23.110 --> 06:24.696
If I keep pestering you,

06:24.720 --> 06:26.826
you'll ask these servants to kick me out.

06:26.850 --> 06:28.416
After I knock them down one by one,

06:28.440 --> 06:30.360
you'll show me a receipt and claim that

06:30.360 --> 06:32.396
you paid it back to Guanghui Bank long ago.

06:32.420 --> 06:33.646
Guanghui Bank only took 70%.

06:33.670 --> 06:36.500
They gave you the rest as hush money, right?

06:40.730 --> 06:42.980
I'm really tired from all the fighting.

06:43.060 --> 06:44.430
Will you just give me back the IOU

06:44.430 --> 06:45.886
so we can skip the violence?

06:45.910 --> 06:48.020
Kick this crazy woman out!

06:56.260 --> 06:58.446
Alright, ma'am. Alright.

06:58.470 --> 06:59.920
I'll go get it.

07:22.950 --> 07:25.400
[Jishan Hall]

07:25.470 --> 07:27.110
Warrior Jin, this way please.

07:27.830 --> 07:29.536
Honey, we have an important guest.

07:29.560 --> 07:31.620
It's Warrior Jin, aka "Ten Taels of Gold"!

07:32.240 --> 07:33.690
Warrior Jin!

07:34.560 --> 07:35.326
Thank you so much

07:35.350 --> 07:37.846
for your monthly donations to the orphans in Jishan Hall.

07:37.870 --> 07:39.110
I'd like to thank you on behalf of them.

07:39.110 --> 07:40.560
Not at all.

07:40.590 --> 07:42.376
I'm only contributing some money.

07:42.400 --> 07:44.076
You two are doing the real work.

07:44.100 --> 07:45.576
You're too modest.

07:45.600 --> 07:46.606
Come on have a seat.

07:46.630 --> 07:48.540
-Take a rest and have some tea. -Have a seat.

07:50.290 --> 07:52.986
The kids are doing well?

07:53.010 --> 07:54.406
Yes.

07:54.430 --> 07:56.750
Why is it so quiet in here?

07:58.650 --> 08:02.970
[Jia Chang'an, Jishan Hall]

07:58.650 --> 08:03.220
[Mrs. Jia, Jishan Hall]

08:00.400 --> 08:01.326
Warrior Jin,

08:01.350 --> 08:02.360
you're apparently

08:02.380 --> 08:03.846
a man with no experience with kids.

08:03.870 --> 08:04.886
At this time of the day,

08:04.910 --> 08:07.180
they're having their nap after lunch.

08:08.110 --> 08:10.206
I'm not able to take care of the orphan

08:10.230 --> 08:11.726
that was entrusted to me.

08:11.750 --> 08:13.246
Thankfully there is Jishan Hall.

08:13.270 --> 08:14.266
You're too kind.

08:14.290 --> 08:15.626
I'll get you the ledger.

08:15.650 --> 08:16.956
No, wait.

08:16.980 --> 08:19.480
I'll leave the details to you two.

08:19.590 --> 08:20.726
You must take a look.

08:20.750 --> 08:22.200
Wait...

08:26.550 --> 08:28.260
Here, Warrior Jin.

08:28.960 --> 08:31.446
You're Jishan Hall's biggest benefactor.

08:31.470 --> 08:32.710
We would feel more at ease

08:32.710 --> 08:34.510
if you can be aware of how the money is spent.

08:34.510 --> 08:35.056
Yeah.

08:35.080 --> 08:36.530
Please have a look.

08:44.630 --> 08:46.966
I-It's all very clear.

08:46.990 --> 08:48.440
Very clear.

08:49.590 --> 08:51.396
Since the kids are asleep,

08:51.420 --> 08:53.270
I'll come back some other time.

08:53.340 --> 08:54.636
Goodbye.

08:54.660 --> 08:55.666
Take care.

08:55.690 --> 08:57.470
-Warrior Jin, I'll see you out. -No need.

09:18.250 --> 09:19.546
Why aren't you asleep?

09:19.570 --> 09:22.690
Did our talking wake you up?

09:24.860 --> 09:26.310
Come on.

09:30.350 --> 09:31.870
What's your name?

09:33.800 --> 09:35.280
Her name is Xiaoyu.

09:36.180 --> 09:37.086
Xiaoyu?

09:37.110 --> 09:39.510
Xiaoyu, say hello to Mr. Jin.

09:39.660 --> 09:42.550
This is the benefactor I told you about.

09:43.510 --> 09:44.626
Please excuse her, Warrior Jin.

09:44.650 --> 09:45.786
She's just a kid

09:45.810 --> 09:47.326
and gets shy in front of strangers.

09:47.350 --> 09:50.230
I will teach them manners in the future.

09:50.350 --> 09:51.476
Never mind.

09:51.500 --> 09:52.980
It's OK.

09:53.920 --> 09:56.336
Be good and eat well. I'll come by again.

09:56.360 --> 09:57.990
I hope you'll be sturdier then.

09:59.130 --> 10:00.580
You heard that?

10:03.180 --> 10:04.806
I'm a bit hard up at the moment.

10:04.830 --> 10:06.880
I'll bring you the money as soon as I have it.

10:07.110 --> 10:08.146
There's no rush.

10:08.170 --> 10:09.576
I'm off.

10:09.600 --> 10:11.520
Warrior Jin, I'll see you out.

10:18.350 --> 10:18.966
He's left.

10:18.990 --> 10:19.796
Far enough?

10:19.820 --> 10:21.270
Yes.

10:23.050 --> 10:27.420
I'll beat the living daylights out of you!

10:28.700 --> 10:29.846
Stop it now!

10:29.870 --> 10:31.266
We'll have to buy another feather duster

10:31.290 --> 10:32.900
if this one breaks.

10:33.980 --> 10:35.196
Our priority now

10:35.220 --> 10:37.456
is figuring out how to deal with Jin.

10:37.480 --> 10:38.486
What's there to fear?

10:38.510 --> 10:40.446
Those kids have been sold anyway.

10:40.470 --> 10:42.206
There's no changing that.

10:42.230 --> 10:43.950
We'll come up with something.

10:45.990 --> 10:47.870
Enough with the staring! Come out now!

10:48.310 --> 10:48.996
Listen,

10:49.020 --> 10:50.616
if you don't behave yourself,

10:50.640 --> 10:52.466
I'll break your legs!

10:52.490 --> 10:53.940
Got it?

10:54.230 --> 10:58.160
Don't! I won't do it again.

10:56.830 --> 11:00.310
[Jishan Hall]

11:02.700 --> 11:07.940
Bravo!

12:14.610 --> 12:15.486
Do you want it?

12:15.510 --> 12:16.960
No.

12:18.350 --> 12:19.896
-Are you okay? -I’m fine.

12:19.920 --> 12:22.280
Thank you, sir.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.320
Master Kui.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.036
Is everyone here?

12:55.060 --> 12:56.980
All is set as you ordered.

12:57.030 --> 12:57.696
Master Kui,

12:57.720 --> 13:00.580
it's such a clever tactic you're employing.

13:02.190 --> 13:03.526
Fireworks!

13:03.550 --> 13:05.046
Sir, have a look at these fireworks.

13:05.070 --> 13:07.200
There's a whole range of them to choose from.

13:07.220 --> 13:08.496
-All kinds of fun. -No, thanks.

13:08.520 --> 13:10.010
Which kind would you like?

13:10.880 --> 13:12.146
Take this money.

13:12.170 --> 13:13.120
I'll leave my stuff with you for now

13:13.140 --> 13:14.206
and pick it up later.

13:14.230 --> 13:15.680
Understand?

13:15.910 --> 13:17.410
Yes, sir.

13:31.800 --> 13:33.250
Get out of the way!

13:52.950 --> 13:54.400
Go!

14:20.590 --> 14:21.286
Split up!

14:21.310 --> 14:22.760
-OK! -OK!

14:27.920 --> 14:29.370
This way.

14:30.470 --> 14:31.920
Stop!

14:34.950 --> 14:36.400
This way.

14:44.740 --> 14:45.806
Kid,

14:45.830 --> 14:47.606
these silly tricks of yours

14:47.630 --> 14:49.146
won't help you get away.

14:49.170 --> 14:51.190
Well, that was just a joke.

14:53.150 --> 14:56.720
A joke before your death is not too much to ask.

14:57.210 --> 14:58.660
Wait.

14:59.320 --> 15:00.770
Come on out!

15:09.650 --> 15:11.770
Stop playing tricks with me.

15:12.470 --> 15:14.856
Come on, I know you're here!

15:14.880 --> 15:17.550
Are you going to wait until I get hurt?

15:24.660 --> 15:26.320
You brat.

15:36.110 --> 15:37.536
Mr. Mo?

15:37.560 --> 15:39.576
What are you doing here

15:39.600 --> 15:42.010
instead of watching over Guanghui Bank?

15:42.270 --> 15:44.680
Still talking rubbish when you're so dead?

15:45.290 --> 15:47.280
How very arrogant.

15:47.750 --> 15:49.200
Guys,

15:49.900 --> 15:51.350
I want none of them left.

16:20.710 --> 16:22.510
Could've left one to me.

16:23.260 --> 16:24.336
You might as well stay out of this,

16:24.360 --> 16:26.550
or it'd be too gory to clean up.

16:27.920 --> 16:30.430
We would like you to tell Master Qi

16:30.650 --> 16:32.440
to stop messing with Yuntai.

16:32.650 --> 16:34.516
I'll be sure to tell him.

16:34.540 --> 16:35.990
No need.

16:36.030 --> 16:37.236
Upon seeing your body,

16:37.260 --> 16:38.830
Qi will understand.

17:20.110 --> 17:23.060
Were you so sure that I was tailing you?

17:24.459 --> 17:25.666
Wen Cong died in Baiju Town,

17:25.690 --> 17:27.166
and you were able to pass the buck.

17:27.190 --> 17:28.110
But if I lose my life

17:28.110 --> 17:29.606
in Nandu,

17:29.630 --> 17:31.820
how will you explain it to Master?

17:32.540 --> 17:34.296
You came to Guanghui Bank

17:34.320 --> 17:36.146
knowing you were being shadowed

17:36.170 --> 17:38.246
so that Qi Tianfeng would get suspicious of me.

17:38.270 --> 17:40.846
Not bad, kid.

17:40.870 --> 17:42.110
You risked your life

17:42.110 --> 17:44.086
to make me kill those men of the Cao Sect,

17:44.110 --> 17:46.036
for that way I could no longer stay out of this.

17:46.060 --> 17:48.676
If you prefer to keep a low profile,

17:48.700 --> 17:50.340
I'll be the one in the open, you stay in the background.

17:50.360 --> 17:51.810
What do you say?

17:52.230 --> 17:55.290
Do you know why Wen Cong ended up like that?

17:57.630 --> 18:00.186
There're naturally ups and downs in the business world.

18:00.210 --> 18:01.526
For years Wen Cong had been struggling

18:01.550 --> 18:03.376
to compete with the Chamber of Commerce of Nandu.

18:03.400 --> 18:04.656
But he wasn't willing to accept it

18:04.680 --> 18:06.236
and wanted to make a comeback.

18:06.260 --> 18:08.410
The Chamber of Commerce was in Mr. Wen's hands,

18:08.490 --> 18:10.926
which means it was in the hands of Yuntai.

18:10.950 --> 18:14.526
Mr. Wen was only serving the sect.

18:14.550 --> 18:15.110
Why can't it

18:15.110 --> 18:16.996
be in the hands of local merchants?

18:17.020 --> 18:18.946
Why did it have to be Wen Cong?

18:18.970 --> 18:22.340
You sound disrespectful to Yuntai's rules.

18:23.590 --> 18:24.836
Kid,

18:24.860 --> 18:26.446
if you want to team up with me,

18:26.470 --> 18:28.540
consider talking to me nicely.

18:29.030 --> 18:31.030
If you try to play tricks with me,

18:31.790 --> 18:33.740
it'll only make me despise you.

18:53.460 --> 18:55.140
Mo Bufan...

18:56.450 --> 18:59.240
[Rongshun Tavern]

19:12.090 --> 19:14.150
How did it go, Miss Shu?

19:16.720 --> 19:18.686
I'm sorry. I screwed it up.

19:18.710 --> 19:20.160
How do you mean?

19:23.030 --> 19:24.990
I didn't get any money back,

19:25.680 --> 19:27.400
but only these useless papers.

19:32.350 --> 19:35.470
These are some merchants' proof of payment, right?

19:36.310 --> 19:37.796
Why are you not at all surprised?

19:37.820 --> 19:39.340
These are exactly what I wanted.

19:39.750 --> 19:41.430
Why didn't you tell me so?

19:43.580 --> 19:45.566
I-I asked you to collect debts

19:45.590 --> 19:46.350
because it'd make you

19:46.350 --> 19:48.326
go to more merchants when you can't get the money.

19:48.350 --> 19:49.670
If I had asked you to collect

19:49.670 --> 19:51.326
proof of payment,

19:51.350 --> 19:53.500
you might have just slacked off.

20:08.110 --> 20:09.590
Calm down.

20:09.770 --> 20:12.250
I got it. Won't happen again.

20:13.250 --> 20:14.700
Get out!

20:16.440 --> 20:17.726
No problem.

20:17.750 --> 20:19.200
Hurry up.

20:21.710 --> 20:23.096
Wait.

20:23.120 --> 20:24.570
What?

20:25.070 --> 20:28.030
It's best if you can opt for a decent outfit tomorrow.

20:28.270 --> 20:29.526
Don't be mad at me.

20:29.550 --> 20:32.290
Consider it a small gift for you.

20:59.370 --> 21:02.980
[Liansheng House Auction Day]

21:11.750 --> 21:13.650
[Two years ago]

21:12.510 --> 21:14.306
Stop following me.

21:14.330 --> 21:15.780
Young Master.

21:20.150 --> 21:21.236
Shouldn't you apologize

21:21.260 --> 21:22.880
for your reckless driving?

21:34.650 --> 21:35.996
It was my fault.

21:36.020 --> 21:37.670
Please forgive me.

21:44.140 --> 21:47.030
This is from Miss Ke, as compensation to you.

21:49.790 --> 21:51.240
Menglan?

22:13.410 --> 22:14.766
Still not ready.

22:14.790 --> 22:16.870
Why is she so slow today?

22:50.970 --> 22:52.620
What's wrong with you today?

22:55.180 --> 22:56.246
Ten Taels of Gold...

22:56.270 --> 22:57.526
Why are you dressed like a girl?

22:57.550 --> 22:58.406
Why can't I?

22:58.430 --> 22:59.556
But how will you fight?

22:59.580 --> 23:00.826
Come on, have a try.

23:00.850 --> 23:01.876
I can't when you're dressed like this.

23:01.900 --> 23:03.890
Jin doesn't understand it.

23:04.430 --> 23:06.980
I really like your look today.

23:07.790 --> 23:13.616
It's like... Feminine charm concealing chivalry,

23:13.640 --> 23:17.410
tenderness veiling a jade sword's blade.

23:19.460 --> 23:22.476
How come I've never heard these verses before?

23:22.500 --> 23:26.070
The ancients never met this person, this fine view,

23:26.200 --> 23:28.450
so they weren't able to write these verses.

23:29.900 --> 23:31.530
Enough, you two.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.580
[Jingshui House]

23:48.140 --> 23:49.690
What's the occasion?

23:49.870 --> 23:52.590
Why are we here, joining the rich?

23:52.670 --> 23:54.286
Today is Liansheng House's auction day.

23:54.310 --> 23:56.566
Half of the merchants in Nandu are here.

23:56.590 --> 23:58.806
The assets are being sold at a discount. It means profit.

23:58.830 --> 24:00.556
The merchants wouldn't want to miss it.

24:00.580 --> 24:02.160
But we're here...

24:07.140 --> 24:09.140
[Meizhu, Tang family]

24:09.640 --> 24:11.266
[Zhong, Tang family]

24:11.290 --> 24:14.290
[Tang Xiao, Tang family]

24:42.110 --> 24:43.750
That is Tang Xiao,

24:43.800 --> 24:45.640
the leading figure in Nandu's gambling industry.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.806
That woman looks rather aggressive.

24:47.830 --> 24:49.866
The two bodyguards beside him

24:49.890 --> 24:52.130
are said to be top masters.

24:53.020 --> 24:55.690
That guy? I won't even have to go all out.

24:56.480 --> 24:57.946
Today is about the auction.

24:57.970 --> 24:59.406
Swords are of no use.

24:59.430 --> 25:00.880
Show some restraint.

25:23.900 --> 25:25.590
Su Mingyu will be here.

25:27.150 --> 25:28.336
You're watching me?

25:28.360 --> 25:30.310
What exactly are you planning?

25:30.350 --> 25:31.840
To play it by ear.

25:33.740 --> 25:35.286
Please enjoy.

25:35.310 --> 25:36.760
Wait a minute.

25:38.060 --> 25:40.890
Why is the food so unnecessarily exquisite?

25:41.140 --> 25:42.816
This is far from enough.

25:42.840 --> 25:43.476
Now,

25:43.500 --> 25:45.760
get me two more portions of this.

25:45.950 --> 25:47.950
Sure. Coming right up.

25:54.660 --> 25:55.806
Young Master.

25:55.830 --> 25:57.280
Young Master.

26:00.210 --> 26:01.276
Qian.

26:01.300 --> 26:03.020
So you came after all.

26:03.120 --> 26:05.176
Your sister was right.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.616
I'm just looking around.

26:06.640 --> 26:09.440
Take care of yourself.

26:21.280 --> 26:22.730
Mr. Su.

26:23.390 --> 26:24.870
-Join us... -What are you doing here?

26:25.050 --> 26:26.500
Jin.

26:26.930 --> 26:28.380
Did you sleep well last night?

26:29.560 --> 26:31.010
Miss Shu.

26:32.380 --> 26:34.436
Miss Shu looks different today.

26:34.460 --> 26:35.946
Looks strange, doesn't she?

26:35.970 --> 26:36.636
Shut up!

26:36.660 --> 26:37.946
You all get obsessed with Ke Menglan

26:37.970 --> 26:38.806
when you see her,

26:38.830 --> 26:40.280
and I can't dress like this?

26:40.650 --> 26:41.926
Come on, have a seat.

26:41.950 --> 26:43.400
OK.

26:48.650 --> 26:50.100
Why?

26:51.820 --> 26:53.980
I'm not obsessed.

27:00.110 --> 27:01.956
Fellow Nandu merchants,

27:01.980 --> 27:03.346
I hope you're well.

27:03.370 --> 27:05.056
I'm honored to have been appointed by Chairman Su

27:05.080 --> 27:08.720
to be the host of the auction today.

27:08.950 --> 27:11.790
I'm sure you are eager to see the lots,

27:12.030 --> 27:14.580
so I won't go on.

27:15.830 --> 27:18.166
Let's get started then.

27:18.190 --> 27:20.790
Yeah, let's get started.

27:22.370 --> 27:25.006
Please bear with me, Mr. Tang.

27:25.030 --> 27:27.690
We still need to spell out the rules.

27:28.470 --> 27:30.656
As this is an auction,

27:30.680 --> 27:33.170
when the gong sounds, the highest bidder gets the lot.

27:33.590 --> 27:36.416
So please follow the way we do business

27:36.440 --> 27:38.010
and let fate decide.

27:42.210 --> 27:43.660
Miss.

27:47.480 --> 27:49.040
Tomorrow,

27:50.080 --> 27:52.450
the world outside will be the same,

27:52.720 --> 27:56.750
but the future of Liansheng House is uncertain.

27:56.870 --> 28:00.406
If it falls into the hands of Mr. Tang...

28:00.430 --> 28:01.846
I met many like Tang Xiao

28:01.870 --> 28:03.726
when I was in the brothel.

28:03.750 --> 28:04.646
Miss,

28:04.670 --> 28:06.606
there is an army of wealthy young men

28:06.630 --> 28:08.086
who want to marry you.

28:08.110 --> 28:09.916
If you can marry one that's somewhat to your liking,

28:09.940 --> 28:12.500
it'd be better than being bullied by Tang Xiao.

28:15.950 --> 28:17.870
We're of the low and degenerate lot.

28:18.750 --> 28:20.570
It will always be a hard life.

28:21.830 --> 28:25.250
Besides, the imperial government decreed that

28:25.320 --> 28:27.446
this status must be kept for generations,

28:27.470 --> 28:29.620
and we're not allowed to marry a commoner,

28:29.710 --> 28:31.800
not even as a concubine,

28:32.410 --> 28:34.040
but can only be slaves.

28:35.250 --> 28:38.840
But Mr. Su does seem to be infatuated with you.

28:44.770 --> 28:47.640
The third lot is Liansheng House.

28:49.920 --> 28:52.810
We're starting at 1,200 taels of silver.

28:53.540 --> 28:55.726
Please start bidding.

28:55.750 --> 28:57.480
Thirteen hundred taels.

28:57.870 --> 29:00.806
Thirteen hundred taels, by Table A2.

29:00.830 --> 29:02.300
Fourteen hundred taels.

29:05.300 --> 29:06.326
Sit down.

29:06.350 --> 29:09.800
-Fourteen hundred taels, by Table C1. -Two thousand taels!

29:16.110 --> 29:19.330
Two thousand taels, by Table A2.

29:27.810 --> 29:28.960
If you're here for Liansheng House,

29:28.980 --> 29:30.430
why aren't you bidding?

29:34.830 --> 29:36.226
Do remember

29:36.250 --> 29:37.780
to do the unexpected

29:37.990 --> 29:38.766
and wait for the right time.

29:38.790 --> 29:40.936
Two thousand taels, second time.

29:40.960 --> 29:42.410
Three thousand taels.

29:56.020 --> 30:00.510
Three thousand taels, by Table B2.

30:00.540 --> 30:01.526
Mr. Qian,

30:01.550 --> 30:05.470
the Su family is a respectable and wealthy family.

30:05.860 --> 30:08.836
Since when are you so interested in these

30:08.860 --> 30:10.096
niche businesses

30:10.120 --> 30:11.690
with little profit?

30:11.790 --> 30:15.430
Or are you trying to drive up the price?

30:16.470 --> 30:18.940
Three thousand five hundred taels.

30:22.170 --> 30:23.446
Mr. Tang,

30:23.470 --> 30:25.710
please speak with caution.

30:30.410 --> 30:33.330
Three thousand five hundred taels, by Table A2.

30:48.670 --> 30:51.350
Three thousand five hundred taels, second time.

30:52.210 --> 30:53.980
Can you lend me 1,000 taels?

30:56.040 --> 30:58.570
I'll pay you back with interest within half a month.

30:59.690 --> 31:02.570
Normally the interest rate is 3%.

31:04.350 --> 31:07.240
For you, Mr. Su, I'll make it 1%.

31:07.670 --> 31:09.120
Deal.

31:09.200 --> 31:10.650
Four thousand taels.

31:11.450 --> 31:13.840
Four thousand taels?

31:18.700 --> 31:20.366
Have you really got 1,000 taels?

31:20.390 --> 31:23.310
Four thousand taels, by Table B2.

31:27.660 --> 31:29.670
Liansheng House

31:29.760 --> 31:31.886
is worth no more than 3,000 taels

31:31.910 --> 31:34.486
so far as market price goes,

31:34.510 --> 31:35.960
right?

31:37.510 --> 31:38.876
Mr. Su,

31:38.900 --> 31:40.810
got a deep affection for it, eh?

31:50.990 --> 31:53.310
Mr. Su is fond of it.

31:54.150 --> 31:55.506
So am I.

31:55.530 --> 31:57.126
What a coincidence!

31:57.150 --> 31:59.420
Four thousand five hundred taels.

32:24.660 --> 32:26.186
What are you waiting for?

32:26.210 --> 32:27.690
Table A2

32:29.090 --> 32:32.920
bids 4,500 taels.

32:33.010 --> 32:34.460
Mr. Su,

32:35.710 --> 32:37.990
if you want Liansheng House so much,

32:38.030 --> 32:39.526
I could make an investment.

32:39.550 --> 32:41.030
We can bid for it together.

32:45.500 --> 32:46.516
OK.

32:46.540 --> 32:49.950
Mr. Su bids 6,000 taels.

33:15.400 --> 33:18.800
Six thousand taels, by Table B2.

33:26.390 --> 33:29.030
Six thousand taels, second time.

33:37.090 --> 33:39.990
Six thousand taels, third time.

33:59.000 --> 34:01.006
May I know your name?

34:01.030 --> 34:02.730
Why haven't I seen you before?

34:04.740 --> 34:06.250
I'm Yun Xiang.

34:06.590 --> 34:08.040
I'm new here.

34:12.510 --> 34:14.430
Yun Xiang?

34:33.560 --> 34:35.010
Nice to meet you.

34:35.830 --> 34:37.400
This is Nandu.

34:37.640 --> 34:39.120
I'm Tang Xiao.

34:57.950 --> 34:59.400
There's someone over there!

35:19.890 --> 35:22.170
Take Zhang Kui away now.

35:22.760 --> 35:23.406
Give him a proper burial.

35:23.430 --> 35:24.880
-OK. -OK.

35:26.690 --> 35:28.536
You only found out a name?

35:28.560 --> 35:30.010
There's nothing else?

35:30.060 --> 35:31.446
Zhang Kui said that

35:31.470 --> 35:33.750
although Yun Xiang was highly skilled in martial arts,

35:33.940 --> 35:35.900
he had never demonstrated it.

35:36.270 --> 35:37.766
When the news came yesterday

35:37.790 --> 35:39.446
saying he was alone,

35:39.470 --> 35:41.320
Kui immediately gathered the men.

35:41.550 --> 35:43.556
Little did he know that it was Yun Xiang's trap.

35:43.580 --> 35:47.260
The whole dozen men of ours just vanished.

35:47.380 --> 35:50.036
Even if Yun Xiang had killed them all on his own,

35:50.060 --> 35:52.420
he wouldn't have been able to clean it up so fast.

35:52.850 --> 35:56.210
Yuntai probably has other supporters in Nandu.

35:56.360 --> 35:58.480
Go prepare a banknote of 5,000 taels of silver

35:58.680 --> 36:00.540
and bring it to the Tangs' Gambling House.

36:00.780 --> 36:02.230
Master,

36:03.090 --> 36:06.370
we gave them 3,000 taels of silver at most in previous years.

36:08.080 --> 36:09.910
The extra 2,000 taels...

36:10.470 --> 36:12.460
It's half a month's worth of our profit.

36:14.090 --> 36:15.890
It's been decades.

36:16.380 --> 36:19.050
I've had enough of relying on others.

36:19.980 --> 36:21.096
That's the reason

36:21.120 --> 36:23.360
we had to get rid of Wen Cong.
